{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14749","headline":"无题 · 卢纶","name":"无题","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"耻将名利托交亲，只向尊前乐此身。\n才大不应成滞客，时危且喜是闲人。\n高歌犹爱思归引，醉语惟夸漉酒巾。\n囗囗囗囗囗囗囗，岂能偏遣老风尘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢纶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14749.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14749","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}